  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed extension by reason of its size, siting, depth and height would result in a dominant and overbearing form of development having an unacceptable impact on the amenities of the adjoining property No. 14 Chaucer Close through loss of light and outlook contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF, 2024), DMD 8 and DMD 11 of the Development Management Document (2014) and CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010). \r\r",
